+
+## Delivery behavior
+
+Each subscribed event creates one delivery for each active webhook on the event's board. Deliveries POST the event JSON to the payload URL and include `X-Webhook-Signature`, `X-Webhook-Timestamp`, `Content-Type`, and `User-Agent` headers. Delivery history is retained for one week.
+
+A webhook is automatically deactivated after ten consecutive failed deliveries whose failures occur within one hour. A successful delivery resets the failure streak.
